.TH cpp_preprocess 3
.SH NAME
cpp_preprocess \- preprocess a token stream
.SH SYNTAX
.B #include "cpp.h"

cpp_token* \fBcpp_preprocess\fP(cpp_ctx* \fIpp\fR, cpp_token* \fItok\fR);
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBcpp_preprocess\fP performs preprocessor transformations on the token stream \fItok\fR using context \fIpp\fR.

It executes macro expansion and conditional directives, checks that all conditional directives are properly terminated, converts preprocessing numbers to final token representations, merges adjacent string literals, adjusts token line numbers according to line deltas, and returns the resulting token stream.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
cpp_tokenize(3), cpp_tokenize_file(3)